  "instructions": [
    "Heat the sesame oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat.",
    "Add the pork and cook until browned, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the garlic and ginger and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the smoked paprika, dark brown sugar, soy sauce, and rice vinegar, and stir to combine.",
    "Cook for an additional 2 minutes, until the sauce has thickened.",
    "Cook the rice noodles according to the package instructions.",
    "Add the cooked noodles to the skillet and toss to combine with the pork and sauce.",
    "Serve immediately, garnished with chopped scallions and sesame seeds.",
    "Cook pork to an internal temperature of 63°C / 145°F and let it rest for 3 minutes before serving."
